## SSOT Discipline
- Resolve SSOT via docs/SSOT/ssot.locator; do not hardcode paths.
- Do not add new env variables that duplicate meaning; extend docs/SSOT/models.lock.json and re-render.
- For docs duplicated in AgentPM, use Pointer stubs (no content forks).
- Use ci/json_hash.py only; no jq-based canonicalization.
- After edits in services/**, ci/**, docs/SSOT/**:
  - make ssot.env.render && make ssot.env.check
  - make ssot.sync.docs
  - make scripts.unique
  - make agentpm.verify